 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Three essential verbs",
   "texto": [
    "**Pouvoir** (power), **vouloir** (want) and **savoir** (know) are irregular. When one of them is followed by another verb, it is put in **infinitivo**: **Je peux venir** (I can come), **Je veux manger** (I want to eat), **Je sais nager** (I can swim).",
    "Denial surrounds the conjugated verb: **Je ne sais pas nager**."
   ]
  },
